    "text": "The program uses an exact lazy greedy: at each step it places the router that covers the most new target cells per unit of cost, and connects it to the existing backbone by the shortest path.\n\n**Coverage test.** A router at `s` covers the cell at offset `(i, j)` only if the rectangle between them has no wall. That rectangle is the union of the rectangles to `(i-1, j)` and `(i, j-1)`, plus the cell itself. So `ok(i,j) = !wall(i,j) && ok(i-1,j) && ok(i,j-1)`. This is computed outward from the router, at O(1) per cell of the (2R+1)\u00b2 window.\n\n**Gain bookkeeping.** For every non-wall cell, `cov[s]` holds the number of still-uncovered target cells a router at `s` would cover. Coverage is symmetric. So when a target cell `t` becomes covered, the program decrements `cov` for every cell in `t`'s own coverage window. This keeps every `cov` value exact.\n\n**Connection cost.** Backbone cells may pass through walls, so connection cost is a multi-source 8-neighbour BFS distance from the current backbone, with parent pointers. When new backbone cells are added, the BFS runs again from them and only lowers distances.\n\n**Priority.** The key is `cov / (Pr + Pb\u00b7dist)`. Each heap entry stores the `cov` and `dist` values it was computed with.\n- `cov` only ever goes down. On pop, if `cov` has changed, the entry is pushed again with the current value.\n- Whenever `dist` goes down, a fresh entry is pushed.\n\nEvery stale key is therefore an upper bound, and the greedy choice is exact.\n\n**Budget.** A candidate is accepted only if:\n- the router plus its path still fits in the budget, and\n- the 1000 points per newly covered cell exceed the cost.\n\nPath cells are listed starting from the existing backbone, so each one comes after a neighbour that is already connected.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint H,W,R,Pb,Pr; long long B;\nvector<char> wallv,targ;\nvector<char> okbuf;\nint SZ;\n\n// fills out with non-wall cells covered by router at s (s must be non-wall)\nvoid coverCells(int s, vector<int>& out){\n    out.clear();\n    int a=s/W,b=s%W;\n    for(int adi=0;adi<=R;adi++){\n        for(int sr=1;sr>=-1;sr-=2){\n            if(adi==0&&sr==-1)continue;\n            int di=adi*sr;int x=a+di;\n            for(int adj=0;adj<=R;adj++){\n                for(int sc=1;sc>=-1;sc-=2){\n                    if(adj==0&&sc==-1)continue;\n                    int dj=adj*sc;int y=b+dj;\n                    int idx=(di+R)*SZ+(dj+R);\n                    bool v;\n                    if(x<0||x>=H||y<0||y>=W||wallv[x*W+y]) v=false;\n                    else{\n                        v=true;\n                        if(adi>0 && !okbuf[(di-sr+R)*SZ+(dj+R)]) v=false;\n                        if(v && adj>0 && !okbuf[(di+R)*SZ+(dj-sc+R)]) v=false;\n                    }\n                    okbuf[idx]=v;\n                    if(v) out.push_back(x*W+y);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nstruct E{double key;int cell;int cov;int dist;};\nstruct Cmp{bool operator()(const E&a,const E&b)const{\n    if(a.key!=b.key)return a.key<b.key; return a.cell>b.cell;}};\n\nint main(){\n    scanf(\"%d %d %d\",&H,&W,&R);\n    scanf(\"%d %d %lld\",&Pb,&Pr,&B);\n    int br,bc;scanf(\"%d %d\",&br,&bc);\n    int N=H*W;\n    wallv.assign(N,0);targ.assign(N,0);\n    {\n        static char buf[2000];\n        for(int i=0;i<H;i++){\n            scanf(\"%s\",buf);\n            for(int j=0;j<W;j++){\n                char c=buf[j];\n                if(c=='#')wallv[i*W+j]=1;\n                else if(c=='.')targ[i*W+j]=1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    SZ=2*R+1; okbuf.assign(SZ*SZ,0);\n    vector<int> cov(N,0);\n    vector<int> tmp,tmp2;\n    for(int s=0;s<N;s++){\n        if(wallv[s])continue;\n        coverCells(s,tmp);\n        int c=0;for(int x:tmp)if(targ[x])c++;\n        cov[s]=c;\n    }\n    const int INF=INT_MAX/2;\n    vector<int> dist(N,INF),par(N,-1);\n    vector<char> covered(N,0),placed(N,0);\n    priority_queue<E,vector<E>,Cmp> pq;\n    auto keyOf=[&](int c,int d){return (double)c/(double)(Pr+(long long)Pb*d);};\n    auto pushCell=[&](int s){\n        if(wallv[s]||placed[s]||cov[s]<=0)return;\n        pq.push({keyOf(cov[s],dist[s]),s,cov[s],dist[s]});\n    };\n    vector<int> q; q.reserve(N);\n    auto bfs=[&](){\n        size_t h=0;\n        while(h<q.size()){\n            int u=q[h++];int ux=u/W,uy=u%W;int du=dist[u];\n            for(int dx=-1;dx<=1;dx++){int nx=ux+dx;if(nx<0||nx>=H)continue;\n                for(int dy=-1;dy<=1;dy++){if(!dx&&!dy)continue;int ny=uy+dy;if(ny<0||ny>=W)continue;\n                    int n=nx*W+ny;\n                    if(dist[n]>du+1){dist[n]=du+1;par[n]=u;q.push_back(n);pushCell(n);}\n                }}\n        }\n        q.clear();\n    };\n    int b0=br*W+bc;\n    dist[b0]=0;pushCell(b0);q.push_back(b0);bfs();\n\n    long long spent=0;\n    vector<int> backbone,routers;\n    while(!pq.empty()){\n        if(B-spent<Pr)break;\n        E e=pq.top();pq.pop();\n        int s=e.cell;\n        if(placed[s])continue;\n        if(dist[s]!=e.dist)continue;\n        if(cov[s]!=e.cov){ pushCell(s); continue; }\n        if(cov[s]<=0)continue;\n        long long cost=Pr+(long long)Pb*dist[s];\n        if(spent+cost>B)continue;\n        if(1000LL*cov[s]<=cost)continue;\n        // place\n        vector<int> p;int u=s;\n        while(dist[u]!=0){p.push_back(u);u=par[u];}\n        reverse(p.begin(),p.end());\n        for(int x:p){dist[x]=0;backbone.push_back(x);q.push_back(x);}\n        spent+=cost;\n        placed[s]=1;routers.push_back(s);\n        coverCells(s,tmp);\n        for(int t:tmp){\n            if(targ[t]&&!covered[t]){\n                covered[t]=1;\n                coverCells(t,tmp2);\n                for(int x:tmp2)cov[x]--;\n            }\n        }\n        bfs();\n    }\n    string out;\n    out.reserve(1<<20);\n    out+=to_string(backbone.size())+\"\\n\";\n    for(int x:backbone){out+=to_string(x/W)+\" \"+to_string(x%W)+\"\\n\";}\n    out+=to_string(routers.size())+\"\\n\";\n    for(int x:routers){out+=to_string(x/W)+\" \"+to_string(x%W)+\"\\n\";}\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
